      "id": "master-title-node",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# \ud83c\udf0c Master Research Walkthrough: The 77-Paper Knowledge Continuum\n\nWelcome to the master navigational roadmap across the edge-cloud continuum and autonomous agentic AI.\n\n**How to navigate**:\n- Click **'Explore Canvas Board \u2192'** on any Track card below to drill directly into its sub-canvas.\n- Follow the labeled arrow connections to traverse the 5 sequential research stages from foundational surveys to autonomous multi-agent networks.",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-canvas-track-1-foundations-surveys",
      "type": "resource",
      "resourceId": "canvas:track-1-foundations-surveys",
      "resourceType": "canvas",
      "label": "Track 1: Architectural Foundations & Surveys",
      "text": "12 papers surveying edge-cloud architectures, resource allocation taxonomies, and multi-tier edge models.",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
