    },
    {
      "id": "hub-simulation-toolkits",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Foundational Simulation Toolkits\n- **CloudSim**: Discrete event cloud datacenter simulation\n- **iFogSim (Paper 72)**: Fog & edge resource modeling\n- **WorkflowSim (Paper 65)**: Scientific DAG workflow scheduler with failure models",
      "color": "3",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-drl-algorithms",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83e\udde0 DRL Algorithmic Pillars\n- **PPO & DDPG**: Continuous action space scheduling\n- **SAC & TD3**: Entropy-regularized robust offloading\n- **Multi-Agent RL**: Decentralized coordination across fog brokers",
      "color": "6",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200
    },
    {
      "id": "hub-slm-quantization",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u26a1 Edge SLM & Context Efficiency\n- **TinyLLM (Paper 47)**: Quantized SLM execution on micro-edges\n- **Context Compression**: Phased prompt decomposition to prevent token overflow\n- **EdgeShard (Paper 69)**: Collaborative split inference across tiers",
      "color": "5",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200
    }
  ],
